  lines:
  - lineOrder: 0
    speakerId: Narrator
    textTemplate: The bistro's doors are closed tonight. Rent arrived every morning,
      and too few tables filled to cover it.
    claim: {fileID: 0}
    portrait: {fileID: 0}
    backgroundImage: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 927909a3902d09741b64d2196988524c, type: 3}
    emotion: 
    voiceOver: {fileID: 0}
  - lineOrder: 1
    speakerId: Narrator
    textTemplate: 'Cooking healthy food was never the problem: plain staples kept
      your costs among the lowest in town.'
    claim: {fileID: 0}
    portrait: {fileID: 0}
    backgroundImage: {fileID: 21300000, guid: f6b91f3cb252c1641bad7b98b8de6d01, type: 3}
    emotion: 
    voiceOver: {fileID: 0}
  - lineOrder: 2
    speakerId: Narrator
    textTemplate: 'What the neighbourhood was missing was a reason to come in: dishes
      they were craving, and meals that made them excited to return.'
    claim: {fileID: 0}
    portrait: {fileID: 0}
    backgroundImage: {fileID: 21300000, guid: f3f993fdf2cbfa7419a83d8c86aba33d, type: 3}
    emotion: 
    voiceOver: {fileID: 0}
  - lineOrder: 3
    speakerId: Narrator
    textTemplate: Next time, listen to each guest's request and make the healthy
      choice the delicious one. The doors can open again.
    claim: {fileID: 0}
    portrait: {fileID: 0}
    backgroundImage: {fileID: 21300000, guid: ab6b2e72d1aab6f43874bbc2a94a19fe, type: 3}
    emotion: 
    voiceOver: {fileID: 0}
  approvalStatus: 0
  reviewNotes: Bankrupt ending (money below -10 after day 6). Frames the cause as
    too few guests to cover rent, never healthy food. Pending review.
